d 'COMFACTEST': module to test common factor (COMFAC) restrictions for EGLS estimation with AR(1) to AR(4) errors
d
d     comfactest tests whether a static regression with AR(p)
d errors, p = 1, 2, 3 or 4, can be used in place of the
d unrestricted	  regression that adds lags 1 to p of the dependent
d variable and of every non-constant regressor. Write b(0,j) for
d the	 coefficient of regressor j, b(l,j) for the coefficient of
d its lag l, and c(l) for the coefficient of lag l of the dependent
d    variable in the unrestricted regression. 
d
d KW: common factor restrictions
d KW: COMFAC
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261122
d
d Author: Ozan Eruygur,  Ankara Haci Bayram Veli University
d Support: email eruygur@@gmail.com
d
f comfactest.ado
f comfactest.sthlp
